# Baked into the production bundle at build time.
#
# A static build has no dev proxy, so the kiosk must call the backend by its
# absolute URL. This is a public endpoint, not a secret — it is visible in the
# shipped JavaScript either way, which is why it is committed rather than kept
# in an untracked file the next person building the kiosk would not know about.
#
# The origin serving this build must be listed in the backend's CORS_ORIGINS,
# otherwise the browser blocks the response before the app ever sees it.
VITE_API_URL=https://elizade-backend-api-production.up.railway.app
